SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This repository contains two different kinds of material, and the MIT licence
above covers only one of them.

1. COVERED BY THE MIT LICENCE ABOVE — the software

   Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Wagner

   Source code, templates, layouts, stylesheets, build configuration, the
   scripts under tools/, and the project's own process documentation
   (CLAUDE.md, docs/adr/, docs/STATUS.md, docs/meta/).

2. NOT LICENSED — the business content

   Copyright (c) 2026 Iris Zellner,
   Kosmetik- & Sonnenstudio Iris' Sunshine Oase, Herxheim bei Landau (Pfalz)

   The content of the website itself and everything describing the business:
   page copy, service descriptions, prices, opening hours, the business name,
   the logo, and all photographs and image material — including the extracted
   texts of the previous website under docs/inhalte/ and the price and content
   material under docs/analyse/.

   All rights to this material are reserved. It is published here because the
   rebuild is developed in the open, NOT to grant any right of use. It may not
   be copied, redistributed, adapted or used commercially without the written
   permission of the rights holder.

Where the two are hard to separate — a template that has business copy written
into it, for example — the more restrictive term applies to the content and the
MIT licence applies to the surrounding code.

NOTE ON IMAGES: no image is added to this repository without documented source,
licence and evidence. Nothing in this file should be read as a warranty that any
particular image may be reused; the rights situation of the previous website's
image material is explicitly undocumented (see docs/analyse/06-medien-inventar.md).
